<!--
  runRefMultCorrInputs_OO200_SDCC.xml - lightflavorspectra_OO200

  star-submit job for macros/MakeRefMultCorrInputs_OO200.C: event-level histograms (refMult vs
  Vz, ZDCx, nBTOFMatch and run) for trigger-860003 events with |Vz| <= 30 cm, used to build an
  StRefMultCorr-style centrality (Vz and luminosity corrections, pile-up band, NBD refit).
  Same catalog query and 56-run list as the other jobs (runlists/OO200_860003_runs.txt),
  copyInputLocally off, 12 files per job. Reads only the Event branch, so jobs are short.
  Pass 2 (Oct 10 2026): the macro also fills hRefMult_Vz_ZDCx_band with the pass-1 pile-up band
  applied; outputs go to *_pass2 directories so pass 1 is kept.
  Merge, then fit:
    hadd -f rmc_OO200_pass2.root /star/data03/pwg/liggett/RefMultCorr_OO200_pass2/*_rmc.root
    root -l -b -q 'macros/FitRefMultCorr_OO200.C+("rmc_OO200_pass2.root")'

  Before submitting (RCF host, repo root):
    mkdir -p /star/data03/pwg/liggett/RefMultCorr_OO200_pass2 /star/data03/scratch/liggett/schedFiles/refMultCorr_OO200_pass2 /star/data03/scratch/liggett/refMultCorr_OO200_pass2/stdout_stderr
  Submit with:  rm -f RefMultCorr_OO200.zip; star-submit xml/runRefMultCorrInputs_OO200_SDCC.xml
  (SUMS reuses an existing sandbox zip without repacking it: delete it after any code change.)
-->

